+python3 trusted-py2mpy.py solution.py > regenerated-solution.mpy
+TRANSLATOR_EXIT=0
+BYTE_CMP_EXIT=0
+```
+
+See [09-translation-identity.log](evidence/09-translation-identity.log).
+
